WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:06.131
♪♪

00:00:07.925 --> 00:00:08.926
[cheers]

00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:11.094
Sally?

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:13.680
Well hello little flower.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.099
Do you ever feel
like you just don't fit in?

00:00:16.266 --> 00:00:18.018
Small guys like us

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:19.186
we gotta stick together.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.064
Can you move please?

00:00:22.064 --> 00:00:24.024
Today's the championship game.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.359
I'm not moving!

00:00:25.484 --> 00:00:27.152
I made a promise to protect her.

00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:28.904
[grunts]

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.532
Join us in a sit
in on the mound!

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.492
Tell your friends!

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.954
♪ The dandelion speaks ♪

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:38.330
♪ Don't laugh ♪

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:39.248
Not you too.

00:00:39.248 --> 00:00:41.041
♪ She's got some things
to teach us ♪

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.252
You'll never be lonely again.

00:00:43.418 --> 00:00:45.671
♪ Look up, look down ♪

00:00:45.671 --> 00:00:47.881
♪ The sky in the ground ♪

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.259
♪ Getting louder now ♪

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.428
This dandelion seems
to mean a lot

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:54.471
to a lot of people.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:55.514
[cheers]

00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:57.391
♪ Charlie Brown ♪

00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:02.688
Especially my little sister.

00:01:03.272 --> 00:01:05.274
♪♪

